## Release Trigger Strategy

- Tag-based release activation (v*.*.*)
- Semantic versioning enforcement
- Manual workflow dispatch support
- Production branch protection
- Release candidate preparation
- Emergency hotfix procedures

```yaml
# Tag-based release trigger
on:
  push:
    tags:
      - 'v*.*.*'
```

## Pre-Release Validation

- Flutter SDK setup verification
- Dependency resolution confirmation
- Complete test suite execution
- Security vulnerability scanning
- Code quality gate validation
- Documentation completeness check

## Build Artifact Generation

- Release APK compilation
- Release AAB bundle creation
- Signed artifact preparation
- Multi-platform build support
- Asset optimization implementation
- Build metadata collection

```yaml
# Release builds
- name: Build release APK
  run: flutter build apk --release

- name: Build release AAB
  run: flutter build appbundle --release
```

